{
  "version": 1,
  "_comment": [
    "The Steam achievement catalogue. Every id here must also exist in App Admin",
    "with the same id (Valve calls it the API Name); name/description are mirrored",
    "here so tests and any future in-game list read from one source.",
    "",
    "Triggers are declarative and evaluated by arch_rogue.achievements against the",
    "fact table that module builds from meta_progress plus the run that just ended.",
    "Grammar:",
    "  {\"counter\": <name>, \"at_least\": N}   {\"counter\": <name>, \"at_most\": N}",
    "  {\"set\": <name>, \"contains\": \"x\"}    {\"set\": <name>, \"contains_all\": [..]}",
    "  {\"set\": <name>, \"size_at_least\": N}  {\"all_of\": [<trigger>, ..]}",
    "Facts prefixed run. describe only the run that just ended; the rest are",
    "lifetime totals. tests/test_achievements.py asserts every fact named here",
    "actually exists and that boss/archetype/theme literals match the content."
  ],
